cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this Skill, please cite it as below."
title: "ecommerce-price-hunt: a cross-platform price comparison Skill for AI Agents"
abstract: >-
  A prompt-and-playbook Skill that guides AI Agents through human-paced,
  accessibility-based cross-platform price comparison, with unified unit-price
  accounting, a medicine approval-number gate, and a dual-screen HTML report.
  An ancillary open-source project for DSH go; no scraping or automation code.
